# Variants deliberately excluded from this folder.
#
# convert_audio_pack.py reads this file and skips these outputs, so a re-import cannot silently
# resurrect a clip that was auditioned out. Indices are the variant numbers in the output filename
# (Footsteps_Grass_Run_003.ogg -> 3); the surviving clips KEEP their numbering, so existing .meta
# GUIDs and every BlockSoundDatabase reference stay valid.
#
# Format:  <family>: <index>, <index>-<index>, ...      # trailing comments allowed
# Override with --ignore-curated (re-creates everything; only for a fresh audition pass).

# Auditioned out 2026-08-31: these read as walking through a leaf-strewn field rather than on grass
# — harsh and out of place beside the rest of the family. See SOUND_ENGINE_DESIGN.md section 16.
Footsteps_Walk_Grass_Mono: 002, 018-029, 035, 041
Footsteps_Grass_Run: 003
